# Flutter 3.41.9 API pin

This repo builds and ships with **Flutter 3.41.9** (`flutter-sdk/`, `make build-app`; engine + eLinux triplet). Do **not** apply Material / widget APIs from newer Flutter docs (3.44+) or stale 3.24-only guidance.

## Rules

- Target API surface = **3.41.9** (Dart **3.11.x**).
- Prefer matching existing widgets in `app/lws_hmi/lib/` over “current best practice” from latest Flutter marketing docs.
- After Dart UI changes, verify with the pinned SDK (`make build-app` or `flutter-sdk/bin/flutter analyze` in `app/lws_hmi/`). Host/`fvm`/IDE Flutter newer than 3.41.9 is not authoritative for this product.

## Known trap: `DropdownButtonFormField`

```dart
// ✅ GOOD — Flutter 3.41.x (FormField initialValue)
DropdownButtonFormField<T>(initialValue: selected, ...)

// ❌ BAD — 3.24-era `value:`; removed / renamed on 3.41.x
DropdownButtonFormField<T>(value: selected, ...)
```

Use the APIs accepted by the pinned 3.41.9 SDK (`flutter analyze`), not older agent rules that locked `value:`.
